  "description": "A transport-agnostic request/reply bridge for FluxFlow: turns an inbound request stream into a one-way dataflow graph and correlates the response back to the caller by CorrelationId. Reused by HTTP and MQTT triggers.",
  "id": "FluxFlow.Components.RequestReply",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-06-20T17:01:26.67Z",
